orks/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 1509886, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d82fd6cc/uploads/origins/40ea3f18-322c-4c78-bd7a-c897e9a47b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfd748b3408cd4ac66655baa8e629aed", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d82fd6cc/uploads/origins/40ea3f18-322c-4c78-bd7a-c897e9a47b80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d0ac4ed8243e8a08cc0f9a472bac040c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "身長193cmのエルフ、アルフディス（https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x_0TK2gLqP4o-Fk_IjeLpkAcT9Ls187-?usp=sharing）と、アクセル（https://skeb.jp/@_nn_Mr_/works/34）というドワーフが口論しているところを描いてくれませんか？アクセルは150cmですが、彼を...太った、しかし筋肉質（彼は92kg）に見せてください。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@saidanica/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec41efdf/uploads/origins/eaf38ea1-f332-46a2-9285-022895e40a87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4f11a53e21d2880d3d36b9775f1194d0", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 909437, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saidanica/works/23", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 1509886, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/45e337ce/uploads/origins/3d112a1c-a8c7-4098-aace-ec4ac639cccd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0eba22693940f0671dc00326f68f9a8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/45e337ce/uploads/origins/3d112a1c-a8c7-4098-aace-ec4ac639cccd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=639947bba9b8021d0ef4ef685decf4d9", "src_set": ""}, "body": "前回はありがとうございました！\n髭男爵は https://skeb.jp/@saidanica/works/20 で、長身の女の子は https://skeb.jp/@shutenndouji1/works/21 です。ヒゲ男の身長は197cm、長身の女の子の身長は193cmです。服装は変えず、ヒゲ男は毛皮で縁取られたカフスのついたブーツを履いている。また、背の高い女の子は肌が白い。服装は変えないこと。ひげ男にも口ひげをつけ、ヘーゼルの目をしていることを忘れずに。\n昼間、広場で一緒に自撮りをしている二人を描き、背の高い女の子は携帯電話を持ち、ぎこちなくVサインをする。ヒゲ男はとても自信に満ちているように描いてください。どちらもまだ幸せそうだ！\n2つのバージョンを描いてほしい：1つは太くて短いひげを生やした状態、もう1つはひげを生やさない状態だ。ひげがないときは、若々しい顔で描く（ひげは1日で生えそろう）。\n2人の身長を書いて、背が高くてイケメンであることがわかるようにする！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@saidanica/works/22", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 1272614, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8d0f900/uploads/origins/9cee1ec0-661d-4acf-bfc4-80e5b7991821?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a31114a78d4c77e064180841bf105f50", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8d0f900/uploads/origins/9cee1ec0-661d-4acf-bfc4-80e5b7991821?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9974de5390524b69e57040d313e82572", "src_set": ""}, "body": "初めまして！Basser誌で見てからとても好きでいつも拝見しております。\n\n私、声優やバス釣りVtuberとして活動している『いちたろう』と申します。\nこの度新衣装になる予定でして、そちらのイラストをぜひ再田ニカさんに書いてほしいです！。\n\n使用用途はSNSでアップしたり、サムネ等活動用に使おうと考えております。\nもちろん商品化などの商用利用はいたしません。\nですのでできれば人物のみの透過素材もpngでいただけると幸いです。\n\nポーズや雰囲気などはお任せいたします。\n悩ましい場合は、躍動感がでるとうれしいなと思います。\n\n自分のタックルの資料等も添付させていただきます。\n\n以上です、よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/44bmx3kzz6xpvvixv489m/h?rlkey=0m0tn1m0n2gdhw6jmkfmcfrxt&dl=0", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@saidanica/works/21", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 1509886, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43d15d99/uploads/origins/0eeee780-a375-4205-9504-e536813cf119?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=753b254c40e4230eb8fffaf62def4b9d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43d15d99/uploads/origins/0eeee780-a375-4205-9504-e536813cf119?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=658f8898235436833ed8fc9aab437393", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Can you draw BADASS Mercenary Ricky Barnes here without his mask: https://skeb.jp/@naokimineta026/works/552, reading Yuri Hime Wildrose 2014 in a Kinokuniya bookstore: https://i7.nhentai.net/galleries/1363140/1.jpg? Setting is summer 2014, where he is 40-41 years old (Birthday is 1973) visiting Japan, so make him look younger. Also since he lost his left arm in 2015, draw him with his left arm intact, the same appearance as his right side. Here's what his right side looks like: https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/730177913089032212/1101504038094245899/Outfit_for_casimirstryker_5.jpg?width=845&height=676. He has pale skin, and give him a short thick full beard and mustache. He is very tall at 188 cm, and make him look athletic and muscular.\nDraw him with a very confused look on his face (he doesn't understand homosexuality) with question marks around his head and saying \"百合とは何か？\" (He can speak Japanese)\nWrite as a caption on top: “40歳の外人が同性愛について学ぶ（2014年)”\nMake it look very funny!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@saidanica/works/20", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 1509886, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83cdd06a/uploads/origins/3c16c2a5-889d-480e-ba3c-1892917967e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=243b66bdafe9affecbb3111f95fe70a6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83cdd06a/uploads/origins/3c16c2a5-889d-480e-ba3c-1892917967e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45c83dc7135ef6bdab6fd7a58d97b8b4", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I was going to request Yuri, until I saw that you can also draw buff guys.\n\nCan you draw me a big, muscular, bulky guy? His name is Billy McRory, and he is 197 cm tall and 127 kg. Draw him with short black hair and hazel eyes and a short thick full beard. As for his clothes, draw him wearing this jacket: https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/901678122536149052/1083807238411522068/20230310_114113.jpg?width=507&height=676 , over a dark brown tunic, a red scarf, a necklace with a bear tooth on it, and khaki cargo pants with a brown leather belt and fur trimmed cuffed boots. Make him look like a modern day barbarian or a bara character (Billy is not gay though)!\nDraw him standing up and roasting meat over a fire.\nI want you to draw 2 versions: One with his short thick full beard and the other without it. When he has no beard, draw him with a youthful face (he can grow a full beard in one day). For both versions, draw him with a smile!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@saidanica/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 296096, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4a6e6c6/uploads/origins/b04e39b0-2392-49eb-878b-c8b22930527e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63d1652f03b28fd3e14cde9f81a58803", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4a6e6c6/uploads/origins/b04e39b0-2392-49eb-878b-c8b22930527e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=861324a1ef8ef0ecda17976380bfdfdb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "私のOC(https://imgur.com/a/WtTJ55P)のイラスト画像をお願いしたいのですが。\nこの衣装(https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CyTBc7T44ADej8-A-f-18M-gVd9C0KlP?usp=share_link)は、大きなバストと大きなお尻を持つ、太くて曲線的な体型をしています。あなたが作ったこの(https://skeb.jp/@saidanica/works/8)写真に似ています。彼女は、あなたのアートスタイルで、このような全身ポーズの、活発な性格の老婆を見たいと思っていますhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1eYhw9ZUVvTxgTQ44pZAw2LdmgOqZphDk/view?usp=sharing。\n(サインは別レイヤーでお願いします)", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@saidanica/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 232072, "client_id": 2047816, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9233d389/uploads/origins/b763d9af-f1a2-493b-90f7-41b00a79e895?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2be50b8c9aaa4902127cf69a42267af", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9233d389/uploads/origins/b763d9af-f1a2-493b-90f7-41b00a79e895?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=89d9ae006388ab3e6d42fe613c8962cf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは!あなたのアートスタイルがとても好きです！とてもグラマラスです。私のOCをこれで描いてくれませんか？https://drive.google.com/file/d/1D8Op_dozku9VElaaJbAW4bPQx_npYwIN/view?usp=share_link\n\n ポーズはおま